WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.920
Gilgamesh and Balarant.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.710
For a hundred years now,

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:41.040
these two star systems have been locked in a war
whose cause long-forgotten.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.830
As both sides, by now exhausted,
prepared to finally end the war...

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.630
I was ordered into an operation
whose details were kept from me...

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:55.330
for a mysterious prize
which involved attacking an allied base.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:01.790
That day, the accursed war
which had so disrupted my destiny ended.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:05.000
But its end was ultimately meaningless for me.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:11.460
The moment I saw her,
my own unending private war had begun.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.130
The moment I saw her...

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:23.290
UOODO

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.920
Tracker station to ground control.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:24.380
Current status: Program K. Investigating MX-24.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.880
Companions: None. Contacts: None.

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:32.540
Companions: None.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.170
The armistice which finally ended
the Hundred Years War

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.670
was signed right around the time
I deserted the Melkian army.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.750
That was six months ago.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.630
I had slipped away from the military's eyes

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:16.880
and lost myself in the crowds in the city of Uoodo.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.960
Hey, pal! Wanna buy one?

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.330
Genuine animal protein in there!
These little babies taste great!

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.790
Hey, I'm walkin' here!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.830
You don't have anything now. C'mon.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.330
Wanna buy one?

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.790
Triple your money if you hit!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:27.380
600 on black-five.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.580
400 on red-one.
600 on black-five.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.250
The Boone Family!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.420
Help me! Somebody!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.170
All right, you bastard! Let's get outta here!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.420
Uoodo was hell.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:09.170
As much like hell as the battlefields on which I'd fought.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:19.750
Those animals are taking
our overlooking this for granted.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:23.420
It's time we settled our partnership once and for all.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.630
Is there anyone to claim a body?

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.790
If not, they will be disposed of in the incinerator.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:32.290
Is there anyone to claim a body?

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:35.000
If not, they will be disposed of in the incinerator.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.170
Stop it! Let me go!

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:26.080
Come on! Shake a leg!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.880
Take one and get to work!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.080
Work hard and you're guaranteed food.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.790
And do it well. You should be glad to even have a job!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.210
What are they all digging for?

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:10.880
What do those monsters want us to dig up for them?

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.830
New here, huh?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:24.000
You ex-AT guys always have that look in your eyes.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.290
Got a light?

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:27.710
No.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.250
Where're you from?

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.880
What are they all digging for?

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:33.670
Their food.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.460
Jijirium!

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:48.000
We trade it for food.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:52.960
This is what the heat from a bomb blast will do
to computer circuits made from the stuff.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.210
This used to be a computer factory.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.170
But when Balarant attacked the place...

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:03.580
the jijirium in the computer circuits was blown all over.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:06.580
That's what attracted our "employers'" attention.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.000
We trade what we find for food...

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.130
Dig! Quit slackin' off!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.960
Go on, start digging! He'll kill you otherwise!

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:20.790
You, too! Dig!

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.330
Didn't you hear me?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.630
More rain.

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:51.290
You clear on this? If you keep slacking off, I'll kill you!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:04.210
The acid rains had begun to fall again.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:09.380
The war had left us a sickly reddish rain.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:12.420
And now it fell, to slowly but surely
eat away at our bodies.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.000
Hey!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.790
Never mind me!

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.330
Stop it! This is no place
to worry about anyone but yourself...

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.420
You there!

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:33.460
Who said you could rest?!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.210
Dig!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:39.920
Quit goofin' off!

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.330
Stop it! They'll kill you!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.710
Uoodo was Hell.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:07.880
Once again, I seemed doomed to wander its depths.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:33.330
God dammit! I'm running!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.000
I can't take this anymore!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.380
They'll just get someone else to replace me.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.540
I may get killed trying it, but at least there's a chance!

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:45.460
I'm gonna run!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:03.460
Damn it all, the cops who are supposed to be
stopping this are all on the take.

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:10.960
They get five darems of jijirium for looking the other way.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.420
Enjoying yourselves?

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.210
I've been waiting.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.000
Have a drink?

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.500
What's wrong? Since when do you refuse our hospitality?

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:17.920
Boone, don't you think it's time
we severed our relationship?

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.630
What brought this on?

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.630
Times have changed.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.750
You sayin' we've become an eyesore?!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.380
Just waiting to toss us out
as soon as the game turned sour.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.380
I said times have changed.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:02.290
We can't keep using the "chaos of war" as an excuse.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.380
It's too late for you to whitewash this operation.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:15.080
We're both a couple of very dirty fat rats at this point.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:18.460
Don't forget the cat's waiting for us both
outside the same hole.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.210
Maule?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.750
Yeah, boss.

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.080
That's your cut for this week.

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:38.130
Thought I'd up your percentage a bit.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:42.080
So let's hear no more of this sad talk of parting ways.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:17.790
What the...

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.920
Get some light over here!

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.460
Break out! After them!

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:33.000
After them! Don't let 'em escape!

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:48.880
Look... It's the chief of police.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.630
You gotta laugh.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.880
He and the gang were working together...

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:59.830
I was hoping I'd get... some of... his cut...

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.080
Why, you...!

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.210
Son of a...

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:17.880
After him!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:24.750
Don't let him get away!

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.500
You son of a...!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.040
Rescue value C... Hurry!

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:23.080
It was a place that held a familiar scent for me.

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:27.250
With only the cold feel of metal on my hands...

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:30.710
a once-dead warmth now glowed to new life inside me.

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:36.500
And, feeling as safe as a child
held to its mother's breast...

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:39.130
before I knew it, I was fast asleep.

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:55.380
NEXT EPISODE

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:59.790
The predator, the prey, and the scavenger of the scraps.

00:23:00.330 --> 00:23:03.250
A violent city where one cannot survive without fangs.

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:06.040
A city armed with every manner of vice: Uoodo.

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:11.380
Melkia's Sodom, born of the Hundred Years War.

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:14.710
With the scent of cordite still clinging to him...

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:17.250
Chirico finds himself surrounded by dangerous people.

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:19.210
Next time, "Encounter"

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:22.670
Chirico drinks, and the coffee of Uoodo is bitter indeed.

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:23.960
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:23.960
ENCOUNTER

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:45.670
Samishii toki mo

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:49.210
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:55.580
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:59.630
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:03.040
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:09.290
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.290 --> 00:24:12.790
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:12.790 --> 00:24:16.210
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:22.710
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:29.040
Ano hi no anata ga...
